{"ref":"BDB, תָּמַהּ","hw":"תָּמַהּ","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">תָּמַהּ</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. be astounded, dumb-founded (</strong>NH id.<em>;</em> so Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּמַהּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܬܡܰܗ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּמָ֑הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:6\" href=\"/Psalms.48.6\">ψ 48:6</a>; Impf. 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְמַהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.7\">Ec 5:7</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתִמְהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 26:11\" href=\"/Job.26.11\">Jb 26:11</a>, etc.; Imv. mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּמָ֑הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.9\">Is 29:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:5\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.5\">Hb 1:5</a>;—<em>be astounded</em>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.9\">Is 29:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:5\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.5\">Hb 1:5</a> (v. Hithp.), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.9\">Je 4:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁמם</span>, Niph.), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:6\" href=\"/Psalms.48.6\">ψ 48:6</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> caus. <a data-ref=\"Job 26:11\" href=\"/Job.26.11\">Jb 26:11</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> rei at which <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.7\">Ec 5:7</a>; <em>look in astonishment</em> at <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ אִישׁ אֶל־רֵעֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:33\" href=\"/Genesis.43.33\">Gn 43:33</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.8\">Is 13:8</a>.<br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  Imv. mpl. + <strong>Qal</strong> Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהִתַּמְּהוּ תְּמָהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:5\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.5\">Hb 1:5</a> (v. supr.), lit. <em>astonish yourselves, be astounded</em>, but We <strong>Hithpalp.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְמַהְמְהוּ</span>; Gr reads inf.abs <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּמֹהַּ</span> (Marti al. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּתְמָהוּ</span>) for <span dir=\"rtl\">תמהו</span>.","next":"BDB, תִּמָּהוֹן","prev":"BDB, תֵּמָא"}